  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping Dutch business opportunities in water- and climate smart agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Enterprise Agency will organize a seminar in January 2024 in The Hague to update interested Dutch companies and knowledge institutes about developments in Tunisian horticulture. For this purpose, RVO has commissioned this mapping to identify and present business opportunities and potential partners for business and knowledge cooperation in Tunisia. The project also serves as an intervention substantiating the proposed mission in June 2024. The objective of this mission is to explore cooperation opportunities in the field of water- and climate smart agriculture with special attention for youth employment and women participation.</narrative>
  </description>
